//@version=6
// MWM LSD Model (Mangoe) — Liquidity + Supply/Demand indicator
// Source: Mangoe.co "Official Playbook" PDF + 8 YouTube breakdowns (2026).
// Coded to his 5m FUTURES practice (gold / NQ index / ES / crude / platinum videos), not the forex-era 30m rules.
// Model: last opposite candle before a large move = zone -> liquidity swing forms in front (not touching)
//        -> body close above the high that made the liquidity (BOS) -> price sweeps the liquidity and taps
//        the zone (wick only) -> entry on the first directional close (break-of-candle and HTF flip as earlier alerts).
//        SL = deepest wick into the zone. TP 1:3 / 1:4 (his futures default: flat 1:4).
// Rev 2026-09-02: audit fixes.
// Rev 2026-09-05 (v3, from his "last 10 real trades" video):
//        9-hour max structure age (his number), short-term trend gate at the BOS bar, straight-line approach cap,
//        break-of-structure leg cap, HTF 30m/1h flip alert, tap depth + tap volume flags, A/B/C grade in the label,
//        same-bar signal when the tap candle itself closes in direction.
// Rev 2026-09-19 (v4, first frame-by-frame audit of his recorded trades). NOT compiled.
//   v4.1 nine-hour clock runs from the zone's BASE candle (his measure tool: '109 bars, 9h 5m' from the base candle, frame 00010528),
//        not from the detection bar 1 to 4 bars later.
//   v4.2 source look: supply zones the same light green as demand, optional 'Demand Zone' / 'Supply Zone' text, liquidity as a thin
//        solid line in the Liquidity colour (default black) with the word 'Liquidity' on it (frame 00004400).
//   v4.3 straight-line counter restarts whenever the structure makes a new extreme, so it counts retracement swings on the FINAL leg
//        into the zone only (what he calls a straight line). Replay of 9 of his trades on real 5m bars, research/lsd/
//        replay_mangoe_trades_2026-09-19.py: the count moves to his own read on 2 of 3 measurable trades (R2 1 -> 0, R3 2 -> 1) and no
//        signal changes. The cap stays at 1: the replay found NO trade of his killed by it, so the audit's 'raise it to 6' is not applied.
indicator("MWM LSD Model (Mangoe)", "LSD Model", overlay = true,
     max_boxes_count = 250, max_lines_count = 500, max_labels_count = 500)

// ---------------- Inputs ----------------
grpZone = "Zone detection"
maxImpulseBars = input.int(4, "Impulse: max candles to reach size", minval = 1, maxval = 10, group = grpZone,
     tooltip = "Zone = last opposite candle before a move that reaches the ATR multiple below within this many candles. Any candle count qualifies (his examples show 1-3 dominant candles). A candle touching the zone during the move invalidates it.")
impulseAtrMul  = input.float(1.5, "Impulse: min size (x ATR14 before the move)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.25, group = grpZone,
     tooltip = "MWM calibration of his 'large move'. Not a Mangoe number.")
accuracyZones  = input.bool(false, "Accuracy zones", group = grpZone,
     tooltip = "Trim the far wick when the base candle out-ranges the next candle. Mangoe: forex only. On futures: 'we don't use accuracy zones, quite confirmed'.")
maxStructHours = input.float(9.0, "Max structure age (hours)", minval = 1.0, maxval = 48.0, step = 0.5, group = grpZone,
     tooltip = "Mangoe: 'our max structure age is actually 9 hours' (last-10-trades video). Counted from the zone's base candle, as his measure tool does; unresolved zones die after it, and a signalled zone stops being tracked after it (no re-entries).")

grpTrend = "Short-term trend (his first check)"
trendFilter = input.bool(true, "Trend gate: demand only in bullish structure, supply only in bearish", group = grpTrend,
     tooltip = "Mangoe opens every breakdown with the 5m short-term trend: sells only while structure prints lower lows and fails at highs, buys the mirror. Checked on the bar that breaks structure (his 'the only highs we broke were the liquidity highs', so the approach to the zone is ignored). MWM proxy: last confirmed pivot high/low broken by a close.")
trendLen    = input.int(5, "Trend pivot length (bars each side)", minval = 2, maxval = 20, group = grpTrend,
     tooltip = "Swing size for the trend read. MWM number; 5 on the 5m matches the swings he draws by eye.")
showTrend   = input.bool(true, "Mark trend flips (small triangles at the bottom)", group = grpTrend)

grpLiq = "Liquidity & structure"
liqMinLeg     = input.int(2, "Min opposite candles in liquidity leg", minval = 1, maxval = 5, group = grpLiq,
     tooltip = "Mangoe: two candles minimum on the 5m. The swing low itself may print on a green (hammer) candle. He accepted a 1-candle leg once when a 4-candle gap made the swing 'visible'; he calls that 'pretty rare'.")
liqHalfRule   = input.bool(true, "Liquidity in zone-side half (50% rule)", group = grpLiq,
     tooltip = "His fib 0/50/100 from the zone's far edge to the top of the finished structure, checked at the tap: liquidity must sit in the half nearest the zone.")
liqHalfMax    = input.float(0.6, "50% rule: max fraction from the zone", minval = 0.3, maxval = 1.0, step = 0.05, group = grpLiq,
     tooltip = "His fib says 50%; playbook rule 3 adds 'a bit further is fine'. 0.60 is MWM's reading of that.")
maxSweepToTap = input.int(6, "Max bars from liquidity sweep to zone tap", minval = 0, maxval = 30, group = grpLiq,
     tooltip = "Mangoe: 'take our liquidity, tap the zone at the same time'; a retrace between the two 'isn't nice'. 0 = same candle only. 6 (30 min) is MWM's number; MNQ test 04-08/2026: 3 vs 12 changed no signals.")
maxApproach   = input.int(1, "Max retracement swings between BOS and tap", minval = 0, maxval = 6, group = grpLiq,
     tooltip = "Mangoe: price should come to the zone 'in a straight line'; 'only one small retracement' was fine; an approach with its own market structure usually gets only a small reaction. Counts confirmed 1-bar swings against the approach after the last break of structure, restarting whenever the structure makes a new extreme (final leg only). Zones over the cap die with reason 'approach'.")
maxBosLegs    = input.int(2, "Max break-of-structure legs per zone", minval = 1, maxval = 6, group = grpLiq,
     tooltip = "Mangoe on his first loss: several liquidity levels and several breaks of structure = 'much larger structure, not what our setups look like, I generally avoid trades like that'. Two liquidity levels with one break (his NQ win) is fine. Zones over the cap die with reason 'complex'.")

grpSig = "Signals"
useSession   = input.bool(true, "Filter signals by session", group = grpSig)
sessTrade    = input.session("0800-2100", "Session", group = grpSig,
     tooltip = "Mangoe: London or New York session, avoid Asia. His own hours are 08:00-15:00 UK; MNQ volume is New York, so the default runs London open to New York close. Set 0800-1500 for his exact hours.")
sessTz       = input.string("Europe/London", "Session timezone", group = grpSig)
slTickOff    = input.int(0, "SL offset (ticks beyond wick)", minval = 0, group = grpSig,
     tooltip = "0 = SL in line with the deepest wick (his 5m rule). He used 1 tick beyond on crude oil.")
minBodyAtr   = input.float(0.0, "Min signal-candle body (x ATR14)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = grpSig,
     tooltip = "0 = off. Mangoe skips entry candles 'significantly smaller than the candles around it'.")
showBoC      = input.bool(true, "Break-of-candle alert (earlier entry)", group = grpSig,
     tooltip = "After a rejection candle that did not close in direction, alert when price breaks that candle's extreme (his second entry model). No target lines are drawn for it.")
showFlip     = input.bool(true, "HTF flip alert (tap inside a new 30m / 1h candle)", group = grpSig,
     tooltip = "His third entry model: when the zone is tapped inside a fresh higher-timeframe candle and price flips back through that candle's open, he enters on the flip instead of waiting for the close ('over doubled our risk reward'). Intrabar by nature: create the alert with 'Once per bar'. The 'flip' label is drawn only when the bar closes with the flip held.")
flipTf1      = input.timeframe("30", "Flip timeframe 1", group = grpSig)
flipTf2      = input.timeframe("60", "Flip timeframe 2", group = grpSig)
showTargets  = input.bool(true, "Draw SL / 1:3 / 1:4 lines", group = grpSig)
tgtBars      = input.int(40, "Target line length (bars)", minval = 5, group = grpSig)
trackOutcome = input.bool(true, "Colour zone border on 1:4 hit / SL hit", group = grpSig,
     tooltip = "Green border = 1:4 reached, red = SL hit. SL is checked first on a bar that touches both. No break-even (his rule), no re-entry after SL.")

grpQ = "Setup quality flags (label + tooltip, never a gate)"
bigZoneAtr  = input.float(1.0, "Shallow-tap flag: zone taller than (x ATR14)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.25, group = grpQ,
     tooltip = "Mangoe on a loss: a large zone tapped 'not even 50% of the way in' usually goes deeper first. Flag when a zone taller than this is tapped less than 50% deep. 0 = flag every zone.")
volFlagBelow = input.float(0.8, "Low-volume flag: tap-bar volume below (x 20-bar average)", minval = 0.0, step = 0.1, group = grpQ,
     tooltip = "Mangoe: volume 'slowing down' into the zone is 'never usually a good sign', volume picking up on the tap is good. 0 = off. Threshold is MWM's.")

grpUi = "Display"
colDem  = input.color(color.new(color.green, 78), "Demand zone", group = grpUi)
colSup  = input.color(color.new(color.green, 78), "Supply zone", group = grpUi,
     tooltip = "He draws supply and demand in the same light green. Pick red here to tell them apart at a glance.")
colLiq  = input.color(color.new(color.black, 0),  "Liquidity level", group = grpUi,
     tooltip = "Line and its 'Liquidity' text. His is thin, solid and black; use a light colour on a dark chart.")
showZoneText = input.bool(true, "Write 'Demand Zone' / 'Supply Zone' in the box", group = grpUi)
showLiq = input.bool(true, "Show liquidity levels", group = grpUi)
showKilled     = input.bool(true, "Keep invalidated zones (faded)", group = grpUi,
     tooltip = "Every zone the model marked stays on the chart, faded, from birth to the bar that invalidated it (his 'that's invalid' zones). Off = delete them. About 50 zones/week on MNQ 5m, 8 in 10 die from a touch before break of structure.")
showKillReason = input.bool(false, "Label why a zone died", group = grpUi,
     tooltip = "touch = hit before BOS; through/inside = wick past the zone or body close inside; 50% = liquidity too far; linger = swept but not tapped in time; trend = structure against the zone at BOS; approach = too many retracements on the way in; complex = too many BOS legs; age.")

// ---------------- Types & state ----------------
// state: 0 formed (waiting liquidity), 1 liquidity set (waiting BOS), 2 armed (waiting tap),
//        3 tapped (waiting directional close), 4 signalled (tracking outcome), 5 resolved
type Zone
    int   dir       = 0     // 1 = demand, -1 = supply
    float top
    float bot
    int   created   = 0
    int   born      = 0     // bar of the base candle; his 9-hour clock starts here
    int   state     = 0
    float structExt    // highest high (demand) / lowest low (supply) since creation
    float liqLevel
    int   liqBar    = -1
    float bosLevel
    float deepest    // deepest wick into the zone after the tap
    box   bx
    line  liqLn
    label liqLbl
    bool  swept     = false
    int   sweepBar  = -1
    int   tapBar    = -1
    bool  bocFired  = false
    bool  flipFired = false
    int   bosLegs   = 0     // break-of-structure legs completed
    int   bosBar    = -1    // bar of the last break of structure
    int   approach  = 0     // retracement swings since the last BOS
    float tapVol            // tap-bar volume / 20-bar average
    float entryPx
    float sl
    float tp
    int   sigBar    = -1

var array<Zone> zones    = array.new<Zone>()
var array<int>  demBases = array.new<int>()
var array<int>  supBases = array.new<int>()

atr = ta.atr(14)
volSma = ta.sma(volume, 20)
inSession = not useSession or not na(time(timeframe.period, sessTrade, sessTz))
maxAgeBars = math.max(20, math.round(maxStructHours * 3600.0 / timeframe.in_seconds()))

// ---------------- Short-term trend (MWM proxy for his by-eye read) ----------------
phT = ta.pivothigh(trendLen, trendLen)
plT = ta.pivotlow(trendLen, trendLen)
var float lastPH = na
var float lastPL = na
var int   trend  = 0
if not na(phT)
    lastPH := phT
if not na(plT)
    lastPL := plT
if not na(lastPH) and close > lastPH
    trend  := 1
    lastPH := na
else if not na(lastPL) and close < lastPL
    trend  := -1
    lastPL := na
trendChg = ta.change(trend)
plotshape(showTrend and trendChg > 0, "Trend up",   shape.triangleup,   location.bottom, color.new(color.green, 40), size = size.tiny)
plotshape(showTrend and trendChg < 0, "Trend down", shape.triangledown, location.bottom, color.new(color.red, 40),   size = size.tiny)

// ---------------- HTF candle opens for the flip entry ----------------
useTf1 = timeframe.in_seconds(flipTf1) > timeframe.in_seconds()
useTf2 = timeframe.in_seconds(flipTf2) > timeframe.in_seconds()
var int   htfBar1  = 0
var float htfOpen1 = na
var int   htfBar2  = 0
var float htfOpen2 = na
if timeframe.change(flipTf1)
    htfBar1  := bar_index
    htfOpen1 := open
if timeframe.change(flipTf2)
    htfBar2  := bar_index
    htfOpen2 := open

// ---------------- Liquidity pivots ----------------
pl = ta.pivotlow(1, 1)
ph = ta.pivothigh(1, 1)
// opposite-candle count of the leg ending at the pivot bar; the pivot bar itself may be a hammer
legEndDn = close[1] < open[1] ? 1 : 2
downLeg = 0
for j = legEndDn to legEndDn + 7
    if close[j] < open[j]
        downLeg += 1
    else
        break
legEndUp = close[1] > open[1] ? 1 : 2
upLeg = 0
for j = legEndUp to legEndUp + 7
    if close[j] > open[j]
        upLeg += 1
    else
        break

// ---------------- Zone creation ----------------
// Demand: bearish base candle at offset k, bullish candle right after it, displacement from that
// candle's open to the current close >= mult x ATR (ATR measured before the move), and no candle
// after the first one has come back to the zone top. Nested bases inside one move each get a zone.
if close > open
    for k = 1 to maxImpulseBars
        if close[k] < open[k] and close[k - 1] > open[k - 1]
            base = bar_index - k
            if not demBases.includes(base)
                zTop = accuracyZones and high[k] > high[k - 1] ? math.max(open[k], close[k]) : high[k]
                zBot = math.min(low[k], low[k - 1])
                clean = true
                if k >= 2
                    for j = 0 to k - 2
                        if low[j] <= zTop
                            clean := false
                if clean and (close - open[k - 1]) >= impulseAtrMul * atr[k]
                    demBases.push(base)
                    if demBases.size() > 40
                        demBases.shift()
                    hh = high
                    if k >= 2
                        for j = 1 to k - 1
                            hh := math.max(hh, high[j])
                    b = box.new(base, zTop, bar_index, zBot, border_color = color.new(colDem, 40), bgcolor = colDem, extend = extend.none,
                         text = showZoneText ? "Demand Zone" : "", text_color = colLiq, text_size = size.small, text_halign = text.align_center, text_valign = text.align_center)
                    zones.push(Zone.new(dir = 1, top = zTop, bot = zBot, created = bar_index, born = base, state = 0, structExt = hh, bx = b))

// Supply: bullish base candle, bearish candle right after it, displacement down >= mult x ATR.
if close < open
    for k = 1 to maxImpulseBars
        if close[k] > open[k] and close[k - 1] < open[k - 1]
            base = bar_index - k
            if not supBases.includes(base)
                zBot = accuracyZones and low[k] < low[k - 1] ? math.min(open[k], close[k]) : low[k]
                zTop = math.max(high[k], high[k - 1])
                clean = true
                if k >= 2
                    for j = 0 to k - 2
                        if high[j] >= zBot
                            clean := false
                if clean and (open[k - 1] - close) >= impulseAtrMul * atr[k]
                    supBases.push(base)
                    if supBases.size() > 40
                        supBases.shift()
                    ll = low
                    if k >= 2
                        for j = 1 to k - 1
                            ll := math.min(ll, low[j])
                    b = box.new(base, zTop, bar_index, zBot, border_color = color.new(colSup, 40), bgcolor = colSup, extend = extend.none,
                         text = showZoneText ? "Supply Zone" : "", text_color = colLiq, text_size = size.small, text_halign = text.align_center, text_valign = text.align_center)
                    zones.push(Zone.new(dir = -1, top = zTop, bot = zBot, created = bar_index, born = base, state = 0, structExt = ll, bx = b))

// ---------------- Signal flags (for alerts) ----------------
demandSignal = false
supplySignal = false
bocLong      = false
bocShort     = false
flipLong     = false
flipShort    = false
zoneTapped   = false
liqSwept     = false

// ---------------- Helpers ----------------
// grade + tooltip for the signal label: A = clean on every flag he names, B = one miss, C = two or more
f_grade(Zone z, bool shallow, bool lowVol) =>
    misses = (z.approach > 0 ? 1 : 0) + (z.bosLegs > 1 ? 1 : 0) + (shallow ? 1 : 0) + (lowVol ? 1 : 0)
    misses == 0 ? "A" : misses == 1 ? "B" : "C"

f_tip(Zone z, float depth, bool shallow, bool lowVol) =>
    "tap depth " + str.tostring(depth * 100, "#") + "%" + (shallow ? " (shallow, large zone)" : "") +
     "\ntap volume " + (na(z.tapVol) ? "n/a" : str.tostring(z.tapVol, "#.##") + "x avg") + (lowVol ? " (slowing)" : "") +
     "\nretracement swings on approach " + str.tostring(z.approach) +
     "\nbreak-of-structure legs " + str.tostring(z.bosLegs) +
     "\nstructure age " + str.tostring((bar_index - z.born) * timeframe.in_seconds() / 3600.0, "#.#") + " h"

// ---------------- Zone lifecycle ----------------
if zones.size() > 0
    for i = zones.size() - 1 to 0
        z = zones.get(i)
        kill = false   // drop from array (box faded or deleted)
        kr   = ""      // kill reason
        done = false   // keep drawings, drop from array
        if bar_index > z.created
            if z.state < 4 and bar_index - z.born > maxAgeBars
                kill := true
                kr := "age"
            else if z.state == 4 and bar_index - z.born > maxAgeBars
                done := true
            else if z.dir == 1
                // ================= DEMAND =================
                if z.state <= 2
                    if z.state < 2 and low <= z.top
                        kill := true    // touched before BOS: liquidity leg / opposing candle hit the zone
                        kr := "touch"
                    else if z.state == 2 and (low < z.bot or (close < z.top and close > z.bot))
                        kill := true    // wick through the zone, or body close inside (edge close is fine)
                        kr := low < z.bot ? "through" : "inside"
                    else
                        // new swing low in front of the zone (before any sweep) = liquidity; each one needs its own BOS
                        newLiq = not z.swept and not na(pl) and pl > z.top and downLeg >= liqMinLeg
                        if newLiq
                            z.liqLevel := pl
                            z.liqBar   := bar_index - 1
                            z.bosLevel := z.structExt     // highest high BEFORE this bar (same-bar BOS possible)
                            z.state    := 1
                            if showLiq
                                if not na(z.liqLn)
                                    z.liqLn.delete()
                                z.liqLn := line.new(z.liqBar, z.liqLevel, bar_index, z.liqLevel, color = colLiq, style = line.style_solid, width = 1)
                                if not na(z.liqLbl)
                                    z.liqLbl.delete()
                                z.liqLbl := label.new(z.liqBar, z.liqLevel, "Liquidity", yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_none, textcolor = colLiq, size = size.small)
                        if z.state == 1 and close > z.bosLevel
                            z.state   := 2
                            z.bosLegs  := z.bosLegs + 1
                            z.bosBar   := bar_index
                            z.approach := 0
                            if trendFilter and trend != 1
                                kill := true    // his first check: no bullish short-term structure at the break
                                kr := "trend"
                            else if z.bosLegs > maxBosLegs
                                kill := true    // staircase of liquidity + BOS legs: 'much larger structure'
                                kr := "complex"
                        if not kill and z.state == 2 and not newLiq
                            if not na(pl) and pl > z.top and bar_index - 1 > z.bosBar
                                z.approach := z.approach + 1   // a bounce on the way down: market structure against a straight-line approach
                            if not z.swept and low < z.liqLevel
                                z.swept    := true
                                z.sweepBar := bar_index
                                liqSwept   := true
                                if not na(z.liqLn)
                                    z.liqLn.set_x2(bar_index)
                            if low <= z.top
                                // tap: 50% rule on the finished structure (his fib from zone bottom to structure top)
                                if liqHalfRule and z.liqLevel > z.bot + liqHalfMax * (z.structExt - z.bot)
                                    kill := true
                                    kr := "50%"
                                else if z.approach > maxApproach
                                    kill := true
                                    kr := "approach"
                                else
                                    z.deepest := low
                                    z.state   := 3
                                    z.tapBar  := bar_index
                                    z.tapVol  := volSma > 0 ? volume / volSma : na
                                    zoneTapped := true
                                    if not na(z.liqLn)
                                        z.liqLn.set_x2(bar_index)
                            else if z.swept and bar_index - z.sweepBar > maxSweepToTap
                                kill := true    // took the liquidity, then lingered instead of tapping
                                kr := "linger"
                    if not kill and z.state <= 2
                        if high > z.structExt
                            z.approach := 0   // v4.3: new structure extreme, only the final leg into the zone counts
                        z.structExt := math.max(z.structExt, high)
                // state 3 runs on the tap bar too: a hammer that taps and closes bullish IS his entry candle
                if not kill and z.state == 3
                    if low < z.bot or (close < z.top and close > z.bot)
                        kill := true
                        kr := low < z.bot ? "through" : "inside"
                    else
                        if low <= z.top
                            z.deepest := math.min(z.deepest, low)
                        // break of candle: previous bar rejected without a bullish close, this bar takes its high
                        bocNow = false
                        if showBoC and not z.bocFired and inSession and bar_index > z.tapBar and close[1] <= open[1] and high > high[1]
                            z.bocFired := true
                            bocNow  := true
                            bocLong := true
                        // HTF flip: tapped inside the current 30m / 1h candle and price is back above that candle's open
                        flipNow = false
                        if showFlip and not z.flipFired and inSession
                            f1 = useTf1 and z.tapBar >= htfBar1 and htfOpen1 > z.top and close > htfOpen1
                            f2 = useTf2 and z.tapBar >= htfBar2 and htfOpen2 > z.top and close > htfOpen2
                            if f1 or f2
                                z.flipFired := true
                                flipNow  := true
                                flipLong := true
                        if close > open and close >= z.top and (close - open) >= minBodyAtr * atr
                            if inSession
                                demandSignal := true
                                z.state   := 4
                                z.sigBar  := bar_index
                                z.entryPx := close
                                z.sl      := z.deepest - slTickOff * syminfo.mintick
                                z.tp      := close + 4 * (close - z.sl)
                                z.bx.set_border_color(color.new(color.blue, 0))
                                zh      = z.top - z.bot
                                depth   = zh > 0 ? (z.top - z.deepest) / zh : 1.0
                                shallow = zh > bigZoneAtr * atr and depth < 0.5
                                lowVol  = volFlagBelow > 0 and not na(z.tapVol) and z.tapVol < volFlagBelow
                                label.new(bar_index, low, "LSD long " + f_grade(z, shallow, lowVol), yloc = yloc.belowbar, style = label.style_triangleup, color = color.green, textcolor = color.white, size = size.small, tooltip = f_tip(z, depth, shallow, lowVol))
                                if showTargets
                                    r = close - z.sl
                                    line.new(bar_index, z.sl, bar_index + tgtBars, z.sl, color = color.red, width = 1)
                                    line.new(bar_index, close + 3 * r, bar_index + tgtBars, close + 3 * r, color = color.teal, style = line.style_dotted)
                                    line.new(bar_index, z.tp, bar_index + tgtBars, z.tp, color = color.teal)
                            else
                                // his first directional close already happened outside session: setup consumed, no signal
                                z.state := 5
                                done := true
                                label.new(bar_index, low, "LSD long (off-session)", yloc = yloc.belowbar, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.gray, size = size.tiny)
                        else if flipNow
                            label.new(bar_index, low, "flip", yloc = yloc.belowbar, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.green, size = size.tiny)
                        else if bocNow
                            label.new(bar_index, low, "BoC", yloc = yloc.belowbar, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.green, size = size.tiny)
                if z.state == 4
                    if trackOutcome and bar_index > z.sigBar
                        if low <= z.sl
                            z.state := 5
                            done := true
                            z.bx.set_border_color(color.new(color.red, 0))
                        else if high >= z.tp
                            z.state := 5
                            done := true
                            z.bx.set_border_color(color.new(color.green, 0))
            else
                // ================= SUPPLY =================
                if z.state <= 2
                    if z.state < 2 and high >= z.bot
                        kill := true
                        kr := "touch"
                    else if z.state == 2 and (high > z.top or (close < z.top and close > z.bot))
                        kill := true
                        kr := high > z.top ? "through" : "inside"
                    else
                        newLiq = not z.swept and not na(ph) and ph < z.bot and upLeg >= liqMinLeg
                        if newLiq
                            z.liqLevel := ph
                            z.liqBar   := bar_index - 1
                            z.bosLevel := z.structExt     // lowest low BEFORE this bar
                            z.state    := 1
                            if showLiq
                                if not na(z.liqLn)
                                    z.liqLn.delete()
                                z.liqLn := line.new(z.liqBar, z.liqLevel, bar_index, z.liqLevel, color = colLiq, style = line.style_solid, width = 1)
                                if not na(z.liqLbl)
                                    z.liqLbl.delete()
                                z.liqLbl := label.new(z.liqBar, z.liqLevel, "Liquidity", yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_none, textcolor = colLiq, size = size.small)
                        if z.state == 1 and close < z.bosLevel
                            z.state   := 2
                            z.bosLegs  := z.bosLegs + 1
                            z.bosBar   := bar_index
                            z.approach := 0
                            if trendFilter and trend != -1
                                kill := true
                                kr := "trend"
                            else if z.bosLegs > maxBosLegs
                                kill := true
                                kr := "complex"
                        if not kill and z.state == 2 and not newLiq
                            if not na(ph) and ph < z.bot and bar_index - 1 > z.bosBar
                                z.approach := z.approach + 1   // a dip on the way up
                            if not z.swept and high > z.liqLevel
                                z.swept    := true
                                z.sweepBar := bar_index
                                liqSwept   := true
                                if not na(z.liqLn)
                                    z.liqLn.set_x2(bar_index)
                            if high >= z.bot
                                if liqHalfRule and z.liqLevel < z.top - liqHalfMax * (z.top - z.structExt)
                                    kill := true
                                    kr := "50%"
                                else if z.approach > maxApproach
                                    kill := true
                                    kr := "approach"
                                else
                                    z.deepest := high
                                    z.state   := 3
                                    z.tapBar  := bar_index
                                    z.tapVol  := volSma > 0 ? volume / volSma : na
                                    zoneTapped := true
                                    if not na(z.liqLn)
                                        z.liqLn.set_x2(bar_index)
                            else if z.swept and bar_index - z.sweepBar > maxSweepToTap
                                kill := true
                                kr := "linger"
                    if not kill and z.state <= 2
                        if low < z.structExt
                            z.approach := 0   // v4.3
                        z.structExt := math.min(z.structExt, low)
                if not kill and z.state == 3
                    if high > z.top or (close < z.top and close > z.bot)
                        kill := true
                        kr := high > z.top ? "through" : "inside"
                    else
                        if high >= z.bot
                            z.deepest := math.max(z.deepest, high)
                        bocNow = false
                        if showBoC and not z.bocFired and inSession and bar_index > z.tapBar and close[1] >= open[1] and low < low[1]
                            z.bocFired := true
                            bocNow   := true
                            bocShort := true
                        flipNow = false
                        if showFlip and not z.flipFired and inSession
                            f1 = useTf1 and z.tapBar >= htfBar1 and htfOpen1 < z.bot and close < htfOpen1
                            f2 = useTf2 and z.tapBar >= htfBar2 and htfOpen2 < z.bot and close < htfOpen2
                            if f1 or f2
                                z.flipFired := true
                                flipNow   := true
                                flipShort := true
                        if close < open and close <= z.bot and (open - close) >= minBodyAtr * atr
                            if inSession
                                supplySignal := true
                                z.state   := 4
                                z.sigBar  := bar_index
                                z.entryPx := close
                                z.sl      := z.deepest + slTickOff * syminfo.mintick
                                z.tp      := close - 4 * (z.sl - close)
                                z.bx.set_border_color(color.new(color.blue, 0))
                                zh      = z.top - z.bot
                                depth   = zh > 0 ? (z.deepest - z.bot) / zh : 1.0
                                shallow = zh > bigZoneAtr * atr and depth < 0.5
                                lowVol  = volFlagBelow > 0 and not na(z.tapVol) and z.tapVol < volFlagBelow
                                label.new(bar_index, high, "LSD short " + f_grade(z, shallow, lowVol), yloc = yloc.abovebar, style = label.style_triangledown, color = color.red, textcolor = color.white, size = size.small, tooltip = f_tip(z, depth, shallow, lowVol))
                                if showTargets
                                    r = z.sl - close
                                    line.new(bar_index, z.sl, bar_index + tgtBars, z.sl, color = color.red, width = 1)
                                    line.new(bar_index, close - 3 * r, bar_index + tgtBars, close - 3 * r, color = color.teal, style = line.style_dotted)
                                    line.new(bar_index, z.tp, bar_index + tgtBars, z.tp, color = color.teal)
                            else
                                z.state := 5
                                done := true
                                label.new(bar_index, high, "LSD short (off-session)", yloc = yloc.abovebar, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.gray, size = size.tiny)
                        else if flipNow
                            label.new(bar_index, high, "flip", yloc = yloc.abovebar, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.red, size = size.tiny)
                        else if bocNow
                            label.new(bar_index, high, "BoC", yloc = yloc.abovebar, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.red, size = size.tiny)
                if z.state == 4
                    if trackOutcome and bar_index > z.sigBar
                        if high >= z.sl
                            z.state := 5
                            done := true
                            z.bx.set_border_color(color.new(color.red, 0))
                        else if low <= z.tp
                            z.state := 5
                            done := true
                            z.bx.set_border_color(color.new(color.green, 0))
        // ---- extend / cleanup ----
        if kill
            if showKilled
                z.bx.set_bgcolor(color.new(z.dir == 1 ? colDem : colSup, 93))
                z.bx.set_border_color(color.new(color.gray, 75))
                z.bx.set_right(bar_index)
                if showKillReason
                    label.new(bar_index, z.dir == 1 ? z.top : z.bot, kr, yloc = yloc.price, style = label.style_none, textcolor = color.new(color.gray, 30), size = size.tiny)
            else
                z.bx.delete()
            if not na(z.liqLn)
                z.liqLn.delete()
            if not na(z.liqLbl)
                z.liqLbl.delete()
            zones.remove(i)
        else if done
            zones.remove(i)
        else
            z.bx.set_right(bar_index)
            if not na(z.liqLn) and not z.swept
                z.liqLn.set_x2(bar_index)

// ---------------- Alerts ----------------
// Signals and break-of-candle: "Once per bar close". HTF flip: "Once per bar" (it is an intrabar entry by design).
alertcondition(demandSignal, "LSD long signal",  "LSD Model: demand tap + bullish close on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(supplySignal, "LSD short signal", "LSD Model: supply tap + bearish close on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(bocLong,      "LSD long break-of-candle",  "LSD Model: demand rejection candle high broken on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(bocShort,     "LSD short break-of-candle", "LSD Model: supply rejection candle low broken on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(flipLong,     "LSD long HTF flip",  "LSD Model: demand tapped inside a new HTF candle, price back above its open on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(flipShort,    "LSD short HTF flip", "LSD Model: supply tapped inside a new HTF candle, price back below its open on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
alertcondition(zoneTapped,   "LSD zone tapped",  "LSD Model: zone tapped on {{ticker}} {{interval}}, watch for directional close")
alertcondition(liqSwept,     "LSD liquidity swept", "LSD Model: liquidity taken out on {{ticker}} {{interval}}")
